# Allowlist: only folders, .cs and .json files are tracked.
# Bundles, binaries and IDE state stay out.

# 1. ignore everything
*

# 2. but descend into directories — git will not look inside an ignored
#    directory, so without this the rules below can never match
!*/

# 3. re-include what we want
!*.cs
!*.json
!.gitignore
!*.csproj
!*.sln
!.gitattributes
!*.targets
!version.txt
!*.png
!*.jpg
!README.md
!LICENSE

# 4. generated trees, which hold .cs and .json of their own
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
.vs/
.idea/